283	/** A claim of a person on a sheet: its amount with two decimals, its date (ISO yyyy-MM-dd), note and status
284	 *  (DRAFT, OPEN, PENDING — a clerk's settle above the clerk limit, awaiting a steward — SETTLED or VOID), its number on the sheet (a sheet-wide 1, 2, ... or, under period numbering, <period>-<n> or X-<n>; null while a draft; a voided claim keeps the one it had), and the due fixed when it was settled
