        </span>
      ))}{' '}
      · Due total <strong data-testid="header-due-total">{sumDues([...dueTotals.values()])}</strong> · Overdue
      total <strong data-testid="header-overdue-total">{sumDues(overdue.map((f) => f.total))}</strong>
    </header>
  );
}
